[{"title":"侍从兴京谒陵二首 其一","author":"胤禛","text":"承先崇报本，桥道驻龙旗。\n万国梯航集，敷天雨露随。\n精诚通寝殿，肃穆奉宗彝。\n敬仰松楸古，昭森盛烈垂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"侍从兴京谒陵二首 其二","author":"胤禛","text":"龙兴基景命，王器结瑶岑。\n不睹艰难迹，安知启佑心。\n山河陵寝壮，弓剑岁时深。\n盛典叨陪从，威仪百尔钦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登望海楼","author":"胤禛","text":"极目澹沧海，涵泓无所从。\n量包天地外，色染古今容。\n浪起思鲲化，云飞羡鹤踪。\n坐观渊默里，万派自朝宗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皇父勘河省不获奉侍瞻恋惭悚交迫于怀敬成一律","author":"胤禛","text":"河槽筹国计，疏导恤民生。\n俯允廷臣请，亲劳圣主行。\n未能随法驾，何以效愚情。\n定省无由达，中宵愧悚并。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"圣驾南巡自春徂夏瞻依心切恭赋斯篇","author":"胤禛","text":"春光荏苒熏风至，圣驾勤民尚未还。\n幸有埙篪随越舸，愁无羽翼赴吴关。\n晨趋北阙螭头上，夜梦南云豹尾闲。\n清陛恭迎堪计日，几回翘首潞河湾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皇父亲祀北郊甘霖大霈恭纪","author":"胤禛","text":"甫竣宣防略，銮回五月中。\n郊原需惠雨，稼穑切皇衷。\n方泽期将界，精禋事必躬。\n礼成霖澍霈，圣意信天通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后即事","author":"胤禛","text":"雨足适新晴，翛然天宇清。\n殷忧舒北阙，栉比望西成。\n殿阁微风度，阶除残暑轻。\n濡毫思志喜，禾黍竞滋荣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15505,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋日怡情亭","author":"胤禛","text":"亭引微风暑气蠲，碧空如洗净云烟。\n地饶佳景供清赏，节送新凉称午眠。\n几处蝉鸣啁积翠，数行鱼队乐漪涟。\n谁云秋色多萧瑟，无限青山入目妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孟秋扈跸观稼恭纪","author":"胤禛","text":"殿角微凉起，豳歌大火流。\n莲房新坠粉，梧叶早惊秋。\n玉露滋芳甸，金风入画楼。\n圣心勤稼穑，躬自省西畴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋得一轮寒月照书橱","author":"胤禛","text":"灿烂书千卷，莹然一镜悬。\n映签光潋潋，透幌影娟娟。\n秘阁搜奇字，芸窗理旧编。\n夜深看愈皎，清坐懒成眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日早朝","author":"胤禛","text":"星疏紫禁启金扉，银烛辉煌映琐闱。\n钟鼓声催仙仗肃，虹蜺影逐彩旗飞。\n寒风几度轻摇佩，瑞雪初飘乍点衣。\n喜睹太平文物盛，天香满袖早朝归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪夜即事","author":"胤禛","text":"永夜漏方中，琼瑶洒半空。\n气侵书幌冷，光闪烛花红。\n兴洽张琴好，心清得句工。\n诘朝恭省候，披拂玉阶风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"元夕","author":"胤禛","text":"皓月高悬不夜城，灯辉万井庆升平。\n臣民语和嵩山语，喧笑声连爆竹声。\n火树拂云飞赤凤，琪花满地落丹英。\n金吾弛禁欢游剧，载路笙歌直到明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏黄河灯","author":"胤禛","text":"华灯夜满原，布置列星繁。\n缥缈探三岛，离奇演八门。\n旌旗随火转，语笑逐风喧。\n寓意藏韬略，游观荷圣恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"早春","author":"胤禛","text":"冻解和风至，璇杓正建寅。\n丛梅初绽玉，余雪已销银。\n柳眼窥人近，莺声到耳新。\n须知迎日处，应早被阳春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次","author":"胤禛","text":"扈跸阅长河，微风起碧波。\n牙樯连百里，珠旆转层坡。\n拂几调琴韵，临窗听棹歌。\n时清多乐事，万汇总春和。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚泊","author":"胤禛","text":"傍柳泊湖船，停桡薄暮天。\n远村烟树里，归雁水云边。\n钓叟垂香饵，樵童曳纸鸢。\n江乡民物美，风景更熙然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顺风放舟","author":"胤禛","text":"长河风力驶，千里片帆轻。\n桨歇村频转，桡停岸自迎。\n野凫冲荇起，归雁拂云鸣。\n试问邮亭吏，何如驷马行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"天津舟中对月","author":"胤禛","text":"初月照扁舟，潮声洗客愁。\n孤村一树矗，隔岸数帆收。\n霄汉闻鸣雁，沙汀玩宿鸥。\n渔歌入夜寂，风景似清秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水围","author":"胤禛","text":"春日猎汀洲，欢声拍浪浮。\n云樯排八阵，桂棹竞中流。\n鸣镝摧腾羽，飞烟罨彩斿。\n昆明夸水舰，岂足拟宸游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日潞河","author":"胤禛","text":"潞河初解冻，桂楫溯潆洄。\n霁色明书帙，春涛劝酒杯。\n云排群鸟度，风鼓万帆开。\n扈从轩游日，惟惭作赋才！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日随驾舟次","author":"胤禛","text":"新柳绿丝柔，依依拂御舟。\n悠扬牛背笛，款乃水边讴。\n翠羽飞桑扈，娇音啭栗留。\n春晴天气好，欢喜奉宸游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"园居","author":"胤禛","text":"十分春色属清明，翠积岚光媚晓晴。\n帘幕争飞村社燕，池台巧啭上林莺。\n青丝摇曳萦烟槛，红雨霏微扑绣楹。\n赋罢小诗清昼永，闲随白鹤柳边行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春郊","author":"胤禛","text":"策马向春田，闲游野趣偏。\n飞花时点袂，舞蝶故随鞭。\n萍密藏溪鹜，风高戾纸鸢。\n酒旗遥入望，茅店古松边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"阅永定河应制","author":"胤禛","text":"帝念切民生，銮舆冒暑行。\n绕堤翻麦浪，隔柳度莺声。\n万姓资疏浚，群工受准程。\n圣心期永定，河伯助功成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"巡子牙河建坝应制","author":"胤禛","text":"承恩随鹢首，私幸睹皇猷。\n躬定安澜策，民无昏垫忧。\n秧针抽覆陇，梅雨洒良畴。\n勉效河平颂，多惭士女讴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭睹圣心勤劳颂扬不尽又成长句","author":"胤禛","text":"叨陪法驾阅新堤，夙夜辛勤悯庶黎。\n底定九河功媲美，时巡三辅典堪稽。\n烟村黯黯青帘扬，岸柳阴阴白马嘶。\n沉璧寘薪诚默契，神人应有绿图携。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日","author":"胤禛","text":"淅沥金风暑渐收，园林景物足清幽。\n青山环列遥如画，云汉斜晖望欲流。\n露咽寒蛩声唧唧，月明野鹤意悠悠。\n丰年不用农人告，手把香粳验有秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"作书","author":"胤禛","text":"搦管曾闻渴骥奔，鱼笺挥洒墨香痕。\n虽惭腕弱无佳致，净几明窗颂圣恩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷花","author":"胤禛","text":"玉井移根种，亭亭曲沼中。\n红衣初坠粉，翠盖晚摇风。\n隔浦纤歌隐，回塘丽影同。\n彩鸳双泳处，珠露泻香丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"对月","author":"胤禛","text":"新秋玉露洗长空，冰镜孤悬映绮栊。\n一片清光凉似水，万年宫树照青葱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"胤禛","text":"一雨收残暑，微凉发树端。\n风清催早桂，气洁媚幽兰。\n曲沼波痕涨，平畴稻颖繁。\n诗成晚霁后，秋月逗烟峦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"驾幸新园","author":"胤禛","text":"警跸临山墅，仙云拂晓来。\n池台增景色，旌盖仰昭回。\n野鸟迎銮舞，闲花傍辇开。\n歌惭鱼藻咏，赋乏上林才。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宫中秋日应制","author":"胤禛","text":"九重殿阁卿云绕，鸳瓦参差丽曙晖。\n北阙轻阴连琐闼，西山爽气裛彤闱。\n疏桐转影遥迎盖，早桂含香乍拂衣。\n欲颂高深言莫罄，朝朝惭戴圣恩归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皇父颁赐御制诗扇恭纪","author":"胤禛","text":"慈恩莫并与天崇，御制遥颁宠锡隆。\n挥洒仙毫凝湛露，捧摇宝扇被仁风。\n四诗寻绎宸章里，八体兼收睿笔中。\n圣蕴难窥真万仞，于兹力学愿磨砻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"禁苑秋霁应制","author":"胤禛","text":"灵囿逢秋霁，西山晓翠张。\n澄波添太液，爽气发长杨。\n丛桂含香嫩，疏桐转影凉。\n宸襟披拂处，鱼藻有辉光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望海楼二首 其一","author":"胤禛","text":"凌霄雄杰耸层楼，碧海苍茫远望收。\n混一乾坤云水阔，濯磨日月浪花浮。\n百川输委盈襟带，万类涵濡任泳游。\n闻道此中覃帝泽，几曾汪秽有停流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望海楼二首 其二","author":"胤禛","text":"朱栏画栋最高楼，海色天容万象收。\n海底鱼龙应变化，天中云雨每蒸浮。\n无波不具全潮势，此日真成广汉游。\n仙客钓鳌非我意，凭轩惟是羡安流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晓度杏山","author":"胤禛","text":"曙色催樵牧，山崖径郁盘。\n霜凝鸦背白，沙印马蹄干。\n海气笼朝旭，林飙送早寒。\n凤城清漏隔，遥忆寝门安。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望医巫闾山","author":"胤禛","text":"翠黛满云封，遥看北镇雄。\n壮观侔五岳，峻秩比三公。\n葱郁兴王气，扶摇广莫风。\n勒铭维祖烈，瞻仰万年同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡句骊河","author":"胤禛","text":"辽水东西岸，寒云接渺茫。\n平沙留雁迹，堠火靖龙荒。\n木落晴峦出，冰坚雪练长。\n经时疏定省，望日陡高冈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒福陵恭颂","author":"胤禛","text":"一峰天柱象昆仑，圣武开基百世尊。\n庙貌辉煌茂剑舄，尘氛荡涤辟乾坤。\n赤龙遐举云留影，石马宵趋汗渍痕。\n赫濯声灵通僾肃，春秋霜露感长存。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒昭陵恭颂","author":"胤禛","text":"钟灵毓秀气佳哉，宇宙从兹景运开。\n帝统兼因文治广，圣基岂独武功恢。\n辽韩海水涵深泽，松杏山高接上台。\n虔肃奉觞恭拜毕，五云飞处久徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避暑口外","author":"胤禛","text":"爽垲高原古上都，郁蒸节候热全无。\n千寻木荫招凉扇，几道泉飞辟暑珠。\n时任镂冰为鸟兽，湾从销夏泛菰蒲。\n何如此地随仙跸，披拂清风胜舞雩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口外山村","author":"胤禛","text":"鸟外窥烟树，微茫碛路斜。\n地寒宜种黍，坡暖好栽瓜。\n比户裁驼褐，居人置兔罝。\n谁将淳朴意，传写入中华？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家即事二首 其一","author":"胤禛","text":"沙碛高低禾黍盈，群飞铜雀绕田鸣。\n竹弓蒿矢堪驱吓，漫向黄云试射声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"田家即事二首 其二","author":"胤禛","text":"戍烽罢举息征尘，肆力耕耘属幸民。\n榆柳阴疏秋社近，缘边笳鼓赛田神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋从猎塞外","author":"胤禛","text":"万里清辉度塞寒，一轮飞镜耀云端。\n穹庐影静金波蘸，行漏声沉玉露漙。\n光射龙沙明远碛，香飘仙桂拂层峦。\n普天今夕同忻赏，何似趋承膝下欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金莲花","author":"胤禛","text":"菡萏敷鲜彩，绚烂云锦重。\n茜裳杂缟袂，擢艳白复红。\n根株遍陂泽，名品将无同。\n昔传天竺师，钵咒青芙蓉。\n非关造物力，色相自虚空。\n独有金莲号，图谱考莫从。\n我来古塞北，野卉竞丰茸。\n罗生岩谷底，琐屑焉能穷？\n灿然睹奇葩，谁施冶铸工！\n六丁鼓炉鞴，几费丹阳铜。\n镂刻成千瓣，片片黄金熔。\n碧茎袅翠叶，挺出薰风中。\n俨如九品台，宝络垂玲珑。\n金仙此趺坐，演偈降狞龙。\n幽芳宜见赏，辇路会当逢。\n亭亭黄屋侧，照耀衔壁釭。\n宸游每披拂，香气向日融。\n愿言植阶砌，净浥清露浓。\n惜哉远难致，忍令伍蒿蓬。\n缀词续花谱，以冠群芳丛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"塞上晚眺","author":"胤禛","text":"倒影余霞丽，晴沙入望平。\n千峰含暮霭，万幕起秋声。\n度垄牛羊下，归鞍雉兔盈。\n割鲜将进酒，边月照高旌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后","author":"胤禛","text":"凉雨晴偏好，边秋气转清。\n虹从林杪断，月傍陇头生。\n落叶飘含润，回沙溜有声。\n仰看群雁度，寒影贴云明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扈驾幸檀柘寺恭纪","author":"胤禛","text":"省耕郊外鸟声欢，敬从祗林拥八鸾。\n法苑风飘花作雨，香溪水激石鸣湍。\n含桃密缀红珠树，嫩箨新抽碧玉竿。\n胜地从容驻清跸，慈云镇日护岩峦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"看竹口占","author":"胤禛","text":"林含虚籁扇清和，翠筱娟娟浥露多。\n结实成阴偏得所，幸邀鸾驭数经过。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"御赐樱桃恭赋","author":"胤禛","text":"朱实才春荐，宫莺啄未残。\n香堪齐蜜荔，味自夺冰丸。\n圆转珠千粒，轻匀露一盘。\n天厨欣惠赐，绝胜驻颜丹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扈驾观麦","author":"胤禛","text":"雨润郊原奉豫游，勤民御辇向西畴。\n摇空翠浪沄沄起，覆垄黄云冉冉浮。\n三白降穰占岁稔，两岐擢秀应农讴。\n伫看比屋连枷动，击壤声中麦有秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旷然尘虑清","author":"胤禛","text":"性静涵真趣，澄观宇宙中。\n未离人境外，顿觉俗情空。\n有色穿帘月，无心过竹风。\n一声长啸罢，俯仰浩靡穷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四时咏应制春","author":"胤禛","text":"土融波暖遍阳春，睍睕雏莺学语频。\n嘉卉满园争献笑，良苗接畛亦怀新。\n韶华有意留三殿，惠泽无边及兆民。\n畿甸时巡东作始，康衢忭舞颂尧仁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏","author":"胤禛","text":"麦黄节候届朱明，百草蕃滋万汇荣。\n槛覆槐阴当午密，阶罗葵萼向阳倾。\n濯枝雨过园林润，解愠风来殿阁清。\n一榻桃笙临水畔，对时育物豫皇情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋","author":"胤禛","text":"碧天荐爽火西流，序转商飙应蓐收。\n警鹤声中清露下，征鸿影外断云浮。\n梧楸萧瑟宜新霁，禾黍离披庆有秋。\n省敛顺时勤御跸，不耽清兴宴琼楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬","author":"胤禛","text":"飘风发发迎严节，瑞雪霏霏增暮寒。\n纳稼三农休蔀屋，飞葭九陛肃郊坛。\n梅疏破腊开温室，竹劲凌霜挺玉栏。\n敬惜岁余聆圣训，忻依内殿日承欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸未岁随驾南巡渡扬子江恭纪","author":"胤禛","text":"敬从泛楼船，春江二月天。\n云开孤塔迥，风送远帆联。\n津柳迎清跸，沙洲接御烟。\n中流回望处，翠岫列晴川。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"癸未中秋对月时以疾假不获扈从出塞感赋","author":"胤禛","text":"十载中秋月，都从北塞看。\n祗今临皎镜，远愧隔鸣銮。\n暑退身差健，宵良意强欢。\n当轩对樽酒，重念圣恩宽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"皓月鉴丹宫","author":"胤禛","text":"新秋爽气满瑶京，鸳瓦流辉一色明。\n耿耿银河低紫禁，溶溶冰镜上丹楹。\n素娥佩冷凌风响，金桂香飘合殿清。\n但愿千秋轮不缺，团圞光彩对常盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小园宴集","author":"胤禛","text":"小园觞饮罢，闲步碧溪头。\n岚秀秋增色，林深晚更幽。\n同吟今夜月，回忆旧年游。\n风景真堪赏，相携逐鹭鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"德州晓渡","author":"胤禛","text":"襟带燕齐此路分，舟梁晓渡马嘶群。\n举鞭南指峰如黛，佳气茏葱结五云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过蒙阴","author":"胤禛","text":"望里东蒙近，微茫草树遮。\n面城峰碍日，绕郭水鸣沙。\n户尽缫桑茧，人多摘茗芽。\n曾闻鲁酒薄，村店一旗斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"扈跸阅河","author":"胤禛","text":"圣主民依切，金堤玉辇临。\n平成齐禹烈，底定慰尧心。\n屡庆禾盈陇，勤栽柳结阴。\n翕河今有颂，鼓枻入歌吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15565,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡扬子江","author":"胤禛","text":"临江山势郁岧峣，江面风和絮乱飘。\n锦缆解开扬子渡，龙旗飞过广陵潮。\n重光丽日悬天镜，几道晴虹驾海桥。\n一曲汾歌怀帝德，榜人齐唱拥兰桡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":15566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]